---
description: Investigate the requested phone question using current owned evidence and relevant native readers.
args:
  goal: string
  card: PhoneFirstRunCard
  previous: PhoneFirstRunEvidence | null
returns: PhoneFirstRunEvidence
---
Establish the current assigned rehearsal from this actual card. Choose which startup observations or installed provider declarations are relevant to the user's question; the available readers are exact native I/O boundaries, not a fixed checklist. Independent observations may be obtained together. A narrow next-step question need not read unrelated startup logs; a claim about observed connection, rendering or package compatibility needs its relevant basis.

Retain useful actual prior observations when refining the same rehearsal, but a previous snapshot does not grant current resume authority. Refresh current evidence when needed, distinguish then from now, and do not carry another card's observations into this one. Return the actual card and assignment. startup or build is null when not inspected, and resume is null unless an actual read-only resume observation was supplied. An unread value is not evidence that the corresponding capability or phase is absent. Do not invent observations or reconstruct an opaque setup request.
